AWS Centralized Log Analysis Architecture

📌 Overview

This project demonstrates the design and implementation of a centralized AWS log analysis solution to monitor and detect suspicious activity across cloud resources.

🛠 Services Used
	•	AWS CloudTrail
	•	Amazon S3
	•	Amazon CloudWatch Logs
	•	AWS IAM
	•	Amazon Athena

🔐 Security Features
	•	Encrypted S3 log storage
	•	IAM least privilege access control
	•	Log integrity validation
	•	Centralized monitoring and alerting
  🎯 Key Outcomes
	•	Enabled centralized API activity logging
	•	Improved visibility into IAM activity
	•	Designed scalable and secure logging pipeline
	•	Implemented monitoring and alerting strategy
